calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025 that pair ran 67% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026 the middle has January to February at 57% and March to April at 58%.</p>"}
